<title>MEXICO: TOLMEX Q1 net falls sharply.</title>
<headline>TOLMEX Q1 net falls sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997		    Q1 1996</p>
<p>	Oper Income	254.51 million	     383.38 million</p>
<p>	Net		  192.9  million	     965.70 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 1.307  bln	     1.391  bln</p>
<p>	Integ fin gain   248.48 million	     29.62  million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos. Full company name</p>
<p>is Tolmex, S.A. de C.V.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559))</p>
</text>
